  "title": "Meta's Personal AI Agent Muse Expands to Instagram and Competes with AI Platforms",
  "summary": "Meta introduces its personal AI agent Muse, which manages tasks like email, payments, and bookings, while also allowing users to create customized spaces in the app for app-like experiences. The product emphasizes its safety and features, while also expanding its enterprise AI initiatives. Meta now integrates Muse directly into Instagram DMs and offers it to users for everyday tasks.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Meta introduces its personal AI agent Muse to manage tasks like email, payments, and bookings, while also allowing users to create customized spaces in the app for app-like experiences.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Meta now integrates Muse directly into Instagram DMs and offers it to users for everyday tasks.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Meta's personal AI agent Muse has achieved significant downloads and user engagement in the U.S. and Canada, outpacing AI platforms like ChatGPT and Grok.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
